# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): a drone out on its own. HOME + PLAY fades drone I out and in (0.3.1),
# beside drone II's SEL + PLAY; from another page HOME's hold is a peek, so the page stays; both out is one badge;
# a knob of a drone that's out says how to bring it back. Not a test of its own (no expectations: main's build plays this script too).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tap PLAY
wav drone-out.wav
wait 2500
# from Life (page 2): HOME held, PLAY: drone I out, drone II plays on; back on Life when HOME is let go
page 2
press HOME
tap PLAY
release HOME
wait 3000
shot one-out-life.png
# drone II too (SEL + PLAY): both out, one badge
press SEL
tap PLAY
release SEL
wait 3000
page 0
wait 100
shot both-out.png
# drone I's knob while it's out: the banner says how it comes back
spin K1 1
wait 200
shot one-off-banner.png
wait 3000
# each back in on its own
press HOME
tap PLAY
release HOME
wait 3000
press SEL
tap PLAY
release SEL
wait 3000
wavstop
